      "intent": "Deliver a cohesive Nocturne charcoal/violet/cyan custom autohiding desktop. Replace decorative workspace controls with a styled Apple menu and the active application real menus, using Accessibility read/press with current-app and stale-request guards. From the far right inward: notifications, clock, weather, then other controls, with spaced section pills. Native calendar reads actual synced events after OS permission; other native panels offer hardware graphs, sound/display sliders and safe device actions. Keep personal team/auth/calendar data out of Git, fullscreen Spaces intact, dock icons fully transparent, models manual and rollback available. Verify native menu/payload boundaries, date math, hover transfers, actions, lifecycle and exact publication proof; apply, merge and push main.",
